================================================================================
When adding a dependency
================================================================================

1. Add an entry here with role, license, and any redistribution obligation.
2. Pay special attention to anything (L)GPL: it must not conflict with shipping
   the closed runtime inside customer games, and relinking rights must be
   preserved where required.
3. Keep the dependency's own LICENSE/NOTICE text alongside the distribution.
